{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxllinedetail\/line"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLLineDetailV4lineAA12MXLStaffLineVvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"line","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLStaffLine","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL12MXLStaffLineV"}],"title":"line","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLineDetail"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"The staff line being configured, counted from the bottom of the staff.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"line","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLStaffLine","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffLine","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL12MXLStaffLineV"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"line","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLineDetail\/line","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLLineDetail":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLLineDetail","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLLineDetail","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLLineDetail","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If the staff-lines element is present, the appearance of each line may be individually specified with a line-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"detail type. Staff lines are numbered from bottom to top. The print-object attribute allows lines to be hidden"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"within a staff. This is used in special situations such as a widely-spaced percussion staff where a note"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"placed below the higher line is distinct from a note placed above the lower line. Hidden staff lines are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"included when specifying clef lines and determining display-step \/ display-octave values, but are not counted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as lines for the purposes of the system-layout and staff-layout elements."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxllinedetail","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLineDetail","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLLineDetail/line":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxllinedetail\/line","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The staff line being configured, counted from the bottom of the staff."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLineDetail\/line","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"line"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL12MXLStaffLineV","text":"MXLStaffLine"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"line"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLStaffLine":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLStaffLine","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstaffline","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffLine","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLStaffLine","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The staff-line type indicates the line on a given staff. Staff lines are numbered from bottom to top, with 1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"being the bottom line on a staff.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLStaffLine","role":"symbol"}}}